{"violation_type":{"id":"tx-tac-746-3415-13","jurisdiction":"TX","state":"TX","code_system":"Texas Administrative Code, Title 26, Ch. 746","original_code":"746.3415(13)","title":"Employee Handwashing After Removing Gloves (26 TAC §746.3415(13))","short_title":"Employee Handwashing After Removing Gloves","severities":{"medium_high":37},"facility_ids":["tx-hhsc-923491","tx-hhsc-1337447","tx-hhsc-104839","tx-hhsc-1471633","tx-hhsc-228214","tx-hhsc-1484438","tx-hhsc-1388160","tx-hhsc-1180100","tx-hhsc-249144","tx-hhsc-1427234","tx-hhsc-1270607","tx-hhsc-1312087","tx-hhsc-1463730","tx-hhsc-287082","tx-hhsc-1120233","tx-hhsc-286946","tx-hhsc-1111152","tx-hhsc-94796","tx-hhsc-1496734","tx-hhsc-1149403","tx-hhsc-1426290","tx-hhsc-95448","tx-hhsc-1465698","tx-hhsc-1370468","tx-hhsc-1355632","tx-hhsc-1396127","tx-hhsc-1502421","tx-hhsc-169497","tx-hhsc-164555","tx-hhsc-1337164","tx-hhsc-1496312","tx-hhsc-1488065","tx-hhsc-1381934","tx-hhsc-1135340","tx-hhsc-1172118"],"first_date":"2022-04-25","last_date":"2026-08-06","typical_finding":"One caregiver was observed not washing their hands after removing their gloves.","finding_variants":[{"text":"One caregiver was observed not washing their hands after removing their gloves.","count":1},{"text":"One staff in Room 4 did not wash their hands after completing a diaper change of one child. The child was removed from the diaper changing mat and joined the remainder of the classroom. The staff proceeded to pick up another child with the same gloves to check the child's diaper for moist, and/or soiled. Shortly after the staff removed the gloves and placed them in the trashcan and joined the classroom. The staff did not wash their hands, and/or the child's hand after diaper changing task was complete.","count":1},{"text":"After diapering, gloves were utilized, a caregiver was observed to not wash their hands after removing their gloves and was going to continue changing additional changing.   Noted: This was corrected during the inspection when the caregiver was advised to wash their hands after removing gloves and in between each diaper change.","count":1},{"text":"Upon reviewing the video footage, it was found that the caregivers did not wash their hands after removing their gloves following the children's feeding.","count":1},{"text":"A caregiver was seen removing gloves after changing a diaper, not washing their hands, and then putting new gloves back on.","count":1},{"text":"Two eyployees did not wash their hands after removing their gloves","count":1}],"topic":"sanitation","topic_label":"Sanitation & hygiene","topic_evidence":"INFERRED","primary_severity":"medium_high","occurrence_count":37,"facility_count":35},"by_year":{"2022":3,"2023":9,"2024":4,"2025":11,"2026":10},"facilities":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-1180100","name":"Texas Kids Childcare","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Katy","zip":"77449","address":"2520 N Mason Rd","capacity":307,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"inspections":52,"last_inspection":"2026-08-28","violations":34,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":19,"occurrences_of_type":2,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-249144","name":"Ferris Christian Academy","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Ferris","zip":"75125","address":"425 W 6th St","capacity":230,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool","school_age"],"inspections":38,"last_inspection":"2026-10-02","violations":79,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":65,"occurrences_of_type":2,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-923491","name":"Trinity Baptist Preschool","type":"center","authority":"TX HHSC","status":"licensed","city":"Gatesville","zip":"76528","address":"1506 W Main St","capacity":100,"age_groups":["infant","toddler","preschool"],"lat":31.433510785094,"lon":-97.776108277524,"inspections":17,"last_inspection":"2026-02-03","violations":9,"open_violations":0,"severe_violations":9,"occurrences_of_type":1,"open_of_type":0},{"id":"tx-hhsc-133